https://hammersmithbid.co.uk/event/summer-festival-event-2026/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"Summer Festival 2026\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t>\n\t\tSummer Festival 2026\t</a>\n</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime-wrapper tribe-common-b2\">\n\t\t<time class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime\" datetime=\"2026-06-29\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">June 29</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-date-end\">August 13</span>\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<address class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue tribe-common-b2\">\n\t<span class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue-title tribe-common-b2--bold\">\n\t\tLyric Square, Hammersmith, London\t</span>\n\t<span class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue-address\">\n\t\tLyric Square, Hammersmith, London, United Kingdom\t</span>\n\t</address>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-description tribe-common-b2 tribe-common-a11y-hidden\">\n\t<p>The Summer Festival is back in Hammersmith for it's 19th year! We'll be bringing another exciting summer of free entertainment and activities for everyone to enjoy. Our much-loved Big Screen will return to Lyric Square...</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</article>\n\t</div>\n\n</li>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<li  class=\"tribe-common-g-row tribe-events-calendar-list__event-row\" >\n\n\t<div  class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag tribe-common-g-col post-39326 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tribe_events_cat-summer-festival-2026 cat_summer-festival-2026\"  >\n\t<time class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag-datetime\" datetime=\"2026-07-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag-weekday\">\n\t\t\tSat\t\t</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag-day