/2026\\/05\\/SF26_calendar_960x540_v1.png 960w\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\talt=\\\"\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\ttitle=\\\"SF26_calendar_960x540_v1\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tclass=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-featured-image\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\twidth=\\\"960\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\theight=\\\"540\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\/>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-details tribe-common-g-col\\\">\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<header class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-header\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h4 class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-title tribe-common-h6 tribe-common-h4--min-medium\\\">\\n\\t<a\\n\\t\\thref=\\\"https:\\/\\/hammersmithbid.co.uk\\/event\\/summer-festival-live-from-wimbledon\\/\\\"\\n\\t\\ttitle=\\\"Summer Festival: Live from Wimbledon\\\"\\n\\t\\trel=\\\"bookmark\\\"\\n\\t\\tclass=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\\\"\\n\\t>\\n\\t\\tSummer Festival: Live from Wimbledon\\t<\\/a>\\n<\\/h4>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime-wrapper tribe-common-b2\\\">\\n\\t\\t<time class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-06-29\\\">\\n\\t\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-event-date-start\\\">June 29<\\/span> - <span class=\\\"tribe-event-date-end\\\">July 12<\\/span>\\t<\\/time>\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<address class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue tribe-common-b2\\\">\\n\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue-title tribe-common-b2--bold\\\">\\n\\t\\tLyric Square, Hammersmith, London\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-venue-address\\\">\\n\\t\\tLyric Square, Hammersmith, London, United Kingdom\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t<\\/address>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/header>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-description tribe-common-b2 tribe-common-a11y-hidden\\\">\\n\\t<p>Wimbledon returns to the Big Screen on Lyric Square from Monday 29 June. Make sure you\\u2019re here for Finals Weekend on 11 and 12 July to experience the best matchday atmosphere outside SW19!<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n<\\/li>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<li  class=\\\"tribe-common-g-row tribe-events-calendar-list__event-row\\\" >\\n\\n\\t<div  class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag tribe-common-g-col post-39426 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tribe_events_cat-summer-festival-2026 cat_summer-festival-2026\\\"  >\\n\\t<time class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag-datetime\\\" datetime=\\\"2026-07-16\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n\\t\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag-weekday\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\tThu\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t\\t<span class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-date-tag-daynum tribe-common-h5 tribe-common-h4--min-medium\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t16\\t\\t<\\/span>\\n\\t<\\/time>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-wrapper tribe-common-g-col\\\">\\n\\t\\t<article  class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event tribe-common-g-row tribe-common-g-row--gutters post-39426 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tribe_events_cat-summer-festival-2026 cat_summer-festival-2026\\\" >\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-featured-image-wrapper tribe-common-g-col\\\">\\n\\t<img\\n\\t\\tclass=\\\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-featured-image\\\"\\n\\t\\tsrc=\\\"https:\\/\\/hammersmithbid.co.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/SF26_calendar_960x540_v16.png\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tsrcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/hammersmithbid.co.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/SF26_calendar_960x540_v16-300x169.png 300w, https:\\/\\/hammersmithbid.co.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/SF26_calendar_960x540_v16-768x432.png 768w, https:\\/\\/hammersmithbid.co.uk\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/SF26_calendar_9